# Add all the application routes to the app.routes file
# NOTE: HomePageController lives in its own `controllers.home` package on purpose.
# It needs a different URL prefix (/manage-cryptoasset-reports) from the mounted
# journey routes (/manage-your-rcasps), so it sits in a separate routes file.
# Keeping it in a distinct package avoids a reverse-router collision with the bare
# `controllers` package routes in app.routes. Do not move it back into `controllers`.
GET        /manage-cryptoasset-reports        controllers.home.HomePageController.onPageLoad()
->         /manage-your-rcasps                app.Routes
->         /                                  health.Routes
